WEBVTT

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.595
Hi, friends. Gani here. This is Growth Mindset: The Word Yet.

00:00:12.595 --> 00:00:17.191
Sit tall in your chair. Feet flat on the floor.

00:00:17.191 --> 00:00:19.948
Hands resting on your desk. Shoulders soft.

00:00:19.948 --> 00:00:22.705
Take one slow breath with me… and let it go.

00:00:22.705 --> 00:00:30.977
Sometimes a sentence gets stuck in our minds: I can't do it.

00:00:30.977 --> 00:00:39.249
There is one small word that can unstick it. The word is yet.

00:00:39.249 --> 00:00:44.763
I can't do it… yet. Yet is a small word that means: I am still learning.

00:00:44.763 --> 00:00:48.440
You can listen with eyes closed, or eyes open, looking softly at your desk.

00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:57.631
Think of something that feels hard right now. A puzzle. A word. A kick, a note, a sum.

00:00:57.631 --> 00:01:04.064
Maybe your mind says: I can't do this. That is the stuck sentence.

00:01:04.064 --> 00:01:12.336
The sentence is not the whole truth. It is only the middle of the story.

00:01:12.336 --> 00:01:21.527
Yet does not promise the hard thing gets easy. Yet just keeps the road open.

00:01:21.527 --> 00:01:31.637
Now say the sentence in your mind, and add one small word at the end: yet.

00:01:31.637 --> 00:01:37.151
I can't do it… yet. I don't understand it… yet. I am not fast… yet.

00:01:37.151 --> 00:01:43.585
Hear how the sentence changes. It stops being a wall. It becomes a road.

00:01:43.585 --> 00:01:49.100
And on a road, there is only one thing to do: keep walking, keep practicing.

00:01:49.100 --> 00:01:55.533
Your yet goes with you — to class, to practice, to home.

00:01:55.533 --> 00:02:02.886
That is Growth Mindset: The Word Yet. One small word that keeps the road open.

00:02:02.886 --> 00:02:05.643
Hands down. One more slow breath… and let it go.

00:02:05.643 --> 00:02:09.320
Eyes open. Look around your classroom.

00:02:09.320 --> 00:02:12.996
You're ready for what's next.
